msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານທີ່ AI ຕ້ອງການ - ຊື່, ທີ່ຢູ່, ເບີໂທ, ເວລາເປີດ, ສະຖານທີ່, URL - ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຍັງຂາດຢູ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3034
msgid "The configured WebMCP URL responded, but the expected API endpoint was not found: %s"
msgstr "URL WebMCP ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຕອບກັບແລ້ວ ແຕ່ບໍ່ພົບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ API ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4162
msgid "The diagnosis and the fixes (basic schema, llms.txt, AI crawler access) all run on the free plan."
msgstr "ການວິນິດໄສ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂ (schema ພື້ນຖານ, llms.txt, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງ AI crawler) ທັງໝົດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນແພັກເກດຟຣີ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3912
msgid "The free plan runs on the criteria bundled with the plugin. Your diagnosis, basic schema, llms.txt and AI crawler access all keep working."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຟຣີເຮັດວຽກຕາມເກນທີ່ມາພ້ອມປລັກອິນ. ການວິນິດໄສ, schema ພື້ນຖານ, llms.txt ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງ AI crawler ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3861
msgid "The last %d measurements, oldest on the left"
msgstr "%d ການວັດແທກຫຼ້າສຸດ, ເກົ່າສຸດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2342
msgid "The license could not be verified. The previously verified plan remains active."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບລິຂະສິດໄດ້. ແພັກເກດທີ່ກວດສອບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2278
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2338
msgid "The license key is invalid or inactive."
msgstr "ກະແຈລິຂະສິດບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2291
msgid "The license server is not configured."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີລິຂະສິດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1444
msgid "The major AI crawlers are allowed in robots.txt."
msgstr "AI crawler ຫຼັກໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນ robots.txt."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2264
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2272
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3463
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3602
msgid "The Nurevo service could not be reached."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍລິການ Nurevo ໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2206
msgid "The Nurevo service is not configured."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1476
msgid "The page text does not state your key facts, so AI has only your markup to go on."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນໜ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ AI ຈຶ່ງມີແຕ່ markup ໃຫ້ອີງໃສ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2193
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2262
msgid "The pairing code is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3461
msgid "The profile sync was rejected by the service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການປະຕິເສດການຊິງຄ໌ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1458
msgid "The raw HTML carries neither your content nor your schema, so crawlers that skip JavaScript see an empty page."
msgstr "HTML ດິບບໍ່ມີທັງເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ schema ຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ crawler ທີ່ຂ້າມ JavaScript ຈະເຫັນໜ້າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4137
msgid "The service could not diagnose this site. This usually means it is not reachable from the internet yet - a local or password-protected site cannot be read."
msgstr "ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດວິນິດໄສເວັບໄຊນີ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເວັບໄຊຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດ - ເວັບໄຊພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ທີ່ປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2902
msgid "The site key is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and configure it."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າກະແຈເວັບໄຊ. ເປີດ WebMCP > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3002
msgid "The site key is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and issue or paste a site key."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າກະແຈເວັບໄຊ. ເປີດ WebMCP > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອອກ ຫຼື ວາງກະແຈເວັບໄຊ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2740
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2906
msgid "The tag.js URL is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and configure it."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ຂອງ tag.js. ເປີດ WebMCP > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2999
msgid "The tag.js URL is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and enter the public tag.js URL."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ຂອງ tag.js. ເປີດ WebMCP > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ໃສ່ URL ສາທາລະນະຂອງ tag.js."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3856
msgid "The trend appears once a second measurement has run."
msgstr "ແນວໂນ້ມຈະສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກການວັດແທກຄັ້ງທີສອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3009
msgid "The WebMCP server did not respond within %d seconds. The URL may be unreachable from WordPress, the Worker may be slow, or Docker/network egress may be blocked."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ WebMCP ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕອບກັບພາຍໃນ %d ວິນາທີ. URL ອາດບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ WordPress, Worker ອາດຊ້າ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອອກຂອງ Docker/ເຄືອຂ່າຍອາດຖືກບລັອກ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3027
msgid "The WebMCP server rejected the site key or admin token: %s"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ WebMCP ປະຕິເສດກະແຈເວັບໄຊ ຫຼື ໂທເຄັນຜູ້ດູແລ: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2956
msgid "The WebMCP server response did not match the expected format."
msgstr "ການຕອບກັບຂອງເຊີບເວີ WebMCP ບໍ່ກົງກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2773
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3040
msgid "The WebMCP server returned an error: %s"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ WebMCP ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບມາ: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2766
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2952
msgid "The WebMCP server returned invalid JSON."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ WebMCP ສົ່ງ JSON ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບມາ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2878
msgid "There is no site key to disable."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກະແຈເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2856
msgid "There is no site key to regenerate."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກະແຈເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:738
msgid "These collect content to train AI models. They are not needed to appear in AI answers, so this is your choice."
msgstr "ພວກມັນເກັບເນື້ອຫາເພື່ອຝຶກໂມເດວ AI. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອປາກົດໃນຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI, ສະນັ້ນທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ເອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:720
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "ພວກມັນດຶງໜ້າເວັບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕອບຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ອ້າງອີງ. ກົດ robots.txt ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ /wp-admin/ ຍັງຄົງນຳໃຊ້ກັບພວກມັນ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4125
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອະນຸມານຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ແລ້ວ. ຕື່ມສະເພາະຊ່ອງທີ່ວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2248
msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດນີ້ເປັນຂອງເວັບໄຊທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ %s. ຈັບຄູ່ຈາກເວັບໄຊນັ້ນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊໃນແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3888
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ beta. ຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັດສິນຈາກແນວໂນ້ມແທນຜົນຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2327
msgid "This license has no seats left. Release another site from the Nurevo dashboard, or use a license with more seats."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ບໍ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານເຫຼືອແລ້ວ. ປົດເວັບໄຊອື່ນອອກຈາກແດຊບອດ Nurevo ຫຼື ໃຊ້ລິຂະສິດທີ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2330
msgid "This license is not attached to an account yet. Please contact Nurevo support."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມກັບບັນຊີ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ທີມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2253
msgid "This pairing code has already been used by another site. Issue a new one from the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເວັບໄຊອື່ນແລ້ວ. ອອກລະຫັດໃໝ່ຈາກແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2333
msgid "This site has no public domain to register. A license can only be activated on a publicly reachable site."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ບໍ່ມີໂດເມນສາທາລະນະໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນ. ລິຂະສິດສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເວັບໄຊທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສາທາລະນະ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2813
msgid "This site is already registered. Regenerate the key with an administrator token if the existing key is unavailable."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ສ້າງກະແຈໃໝ່ດ້ວຍໂທເຄັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ ຖ້າກະແຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2336
msgid "Too many activation attempts. Please wait and try again."
msgstr "ພະຍາຍາມເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2259
msgid "Too many attempts. Please wait and try again."
msgstr "ພະຍາຍາມຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3853
msgid "Trend"
msgstr "ແນວໂນ້ມ"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4257
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "ລອງໃໝ່"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5101
msgid "Turn on /llms.txt"
msgstr "ເປີດ /llms.txt"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5100
msgid "Turn on structured data output"
msgstr "ເປີດການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງ"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1552
msgid "Turns on server-side output of the information AI reads."
